# Invariant 9: a member that cannot process an accepted commit reports it, and three DISTINCT
# reporters against one commit quarantine its committer - a flag on the device and an instance
# Remove of its leaf. Alice's commit is the one bob, carol and dave report; the second report from
# the same device would not count, so each reporter is a different member.
instance dilla
client alice
client bob
client carol
client dave
group chat kind=text target=d7d7d7d7d7d7d7d7d7d7d7d7d7d7d7d7 community=none creator=alice
join bob chat via=welcome
join carol chat via=welcome
join dave chat via=welcome
sync bob
sync carol
sync dave
commit alice
fork_report bob chat
fork_report bob chat
fork_report carol chat
fork_report dave chat
expect_quarantined alice
commit bob
expect_reject E_LEAF_NOT_CURRENT send alice chat still here
